Subject: [PATCH] wasm(net,accounts): http/proxy wasm modules and cfg stubs for
 session/tls/qr

Add net/http_wasm.rs (browser fetch) and net/proxy_wasm.rs stubs, cfg-gate
accounts lockfile, session, tls and qr paths that need sockets or flock.
Unused-on-wasm items are gated or marked as API-parity dead code.

WASM-CORE: prototype 0003 (+0010 fetch, MPL idea). Native impact: none
(cfg-gated; native `bail` import gated so wasm builds without warnings).
